  "explanation": "The question asks when the Dallas County Courthouse was built. Multiple original sources provide conflicting dates for the same building or different iterations of the courthouse:\n\n- **1902** is cited in D1S1, D2S6, and D3S5 as the year the current courthouse was built and dedicated.\n- **1885** is mentioned in D4S4 as the construction year of the courthouse.\n- **July 10, 1850** is stated in D5S2 as the completion date of another courthouse.\n\nThese statements refer to different phases or structures of the Dallas County Courthouse in Adel, Iowa. Since the question does not specify which iteration of the courthouse is being asked about, all valid claims are preserved as distinct referents."
